# Contributing

Thanks for helping improve **{{ project_name }}**.

## Quick start

### Prerequisites

- Python {{ min_python_version }}+
- [`uv`](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)

### Setup

```bash
uv sync --all-groups
```

### Run the usual checks

```bash
poe check
```

### Run tests

```bash
poe test-unit
```

### Build docs

```bash
uv sync --group docs
poe docs
```

## Development guidelines

- Keep changes focused and add tests when it’s practical.
- Run formatting and linting before opening a PR:

```bash
poe fix
```

## Reporting issues

- Bug reports and feature requests are welcome.
- Include steps to reproduce and the output of `poe check`.

## Code of conduct

By participating, you agree to follow the Code of Conduct in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md.
